        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a broad portfolio of device designs, including patented technologies like tag-on-metal, and intellectual property (\"IP\") we have developed working with early adopters of RFID in multiple customer verticals including smart consumer devices and healthcare.",
        "start_character": 6021,
        "end_character": 6283
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a portfolio of three patent families (designs, patents, utility models, patents pending and exclusive licenses) in individual or regional filings, covering products, electrical and mechanical designs, software systems and methods and manufacturing process ideas for our various businesses.",
        "start_character": 16158,
        "end_character": 16455
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also established a dedicated business development team to pursue opportunities within the six applications highlighted in the \"Accelerate\" pillar of our growth plan.",
        "start_character": 13182,
        "end_character": 13355
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have identified three distinct initiatives to accelerate growth - one related to developing business within healthcare, a second related to developing business within several high value applications outside of healthcare, and a third related to expanding our BLE and multi-component technology platform.",
        "start_character": 9731,
        "end_character": 10037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 155 employees, of which 24 were in research and development, 17 were in sales and marketing, 88 were in manufacturing and 26 were in general and administrative.",
        "start_character": 18546,
        "end_character": 18738
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "This is a vision for the future that we share with leading semiconductor manufacturers who supply the chips embedded in our devices.",
        "start_character": 8386,
        "end_character": 8518
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a leader in designing and developing complex, specialty RFID- and BLE-enabled devices.",
        "start_character": 13567,
        "end_character": 13660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are focused on several specific use cases: inventory management of plastic pallets and bins in retail distribution centers;",
        "start_character": 10624,
        "end_character": 10750
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe our design-through-production platform incentivizes our customers to continue collaborating with us as they seek to drive increasing functionality and better performance into the experiences for their customers.",
        "start_character": 7214,
        "end_character": 7436
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We design the inlays, including specifying the chip, designing the antennas, embedding the software, enabling security",
        "start_character": 5647,
        "end_character": 5765
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We design, produce, and sell RFID and Bluetooth Low Energy (“BLE”) enabled devices, primarily RFID inlays, tags, and labels that can be applied or incorporated into physical objects, providing them with a digital identity and the ability for our customers to track, monitor, authenticate, and engage with consumers.",
        "start_character": 4297,
        "end_character": 4612
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126351",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126351-544440dca35e8716",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126351",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have implemented a stage gate process to manage our NPD project pipeline, which is designed to focus our time and R&D resources on the projects with the highest probability of success and discontinue those that we deem financially or technically unviable.",
        "start_character": 9336,
        "end_character": 9594
